WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:15.105
It was late at night.

2
00:00:15.965 --> 00:00:17.847
A guard walked through an old army base.

3
00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:24.053
a quiet night," the guard said to himself.

4
00:00:24.073 --> 00:00:26.516
"Maybe I'll take a nap in the office."

5
00:00:32.696 --> 00:00:35.057
The guard went around the corner of a building and gasped.

6
00:00:37.358 --> 00:00:40.899
"Oh no!"

7
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:41.660
he cried.

8
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.241
"One of the army tanks was stolen!"

9
00:00:49.903 --> 00:00:50.483
is great!"

10
00:00:50.724 --> 00:00:51.324
said Terrell.

11
00:00:51.344 --> 00:00:54.485
"I love being outside on a school day!"

12
00:00:56.546 --> 00:00:58.327
Roxy and her friends were in the school garden.

13
00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:00.628
They were helping Mr.

14
00:01:00.668 --> 00:01:04.153
Green. "Good morning, everybody!"

15
00:01:04.453 --> 00:01:04.874
said Mr.

16
00:01:04.894 --> 00:01:08.136
Green. "We're going to have lots of fun today.

17
00:01:09.176 --> 00:01:11.698
Everybody needs gardening gloves and a trowel."

18
00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:15.980
Roxy and her friends got their gardening equipment.

19
00:01:17.521 --> 00:01:18.122
Jack grinned.

20
00:01:18.142 --> 00:01:20.123
"I can't wait to get dirty!"

21
00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:24.966
"I have lots of seeds for flowers and vegetables," said Mr.

22
00:01:24.986 --> 00:01:28.468
Green. "Each of you can choose what you want to plant.

23
00:01:29.248 --> 00:01:32.369
With time and care, all the plants will grow!"

24
00:01:35.711 --> 00:01:39.352
Mara picked out some sunflower seeds.

25
00:01:39.372 --> 00:01:41.473
"I love sunflowers," she said.

26
00:01:41.493 --> 00:01:44.054
"They're so big and bright."

27
00:01:44.074 --> 00:01:48.716
"I want fresh vegetables for lunch," said Roxy.

28
00:01:49.537 --> 00:01:51.678
"I'm going to plant carrots and lettuce."

29
00:01:54.099 --> 00:01:54.939
Jack made a face.

30
00:01:54.959 --> 00:01:56.920
"Who cares about vegetables?

31
00:01:57.768 --> 00:01:59.229
I just like digging in the dirt!"

32
00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.311
He stuck his trowel into the ground.

33
00:02:03.151 --> 00:02:04.332
He scooped out some soil.

34
00:02:09.154 --> 00:02:11.035
Then he picked up a wiggling, little worm.

35
00:02:11.055 --> 00:02:16.358
"Cool!" Jack held the worm out to his friends.

36
00:02:16.378 --> 00:02:20.621
"Eww," said Terrell.

37
00:02:20.641 --> 00:02:22.822
"Keep that thing away from me!"

38
00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:26.224
"That's gross, Jack," said Mara.

39
00:02:27.348 --> 00:02:29.389
"Worms are cute," said Roxy.

40
00:02:29.409 --> 00:02:32.551
"Plus, they help the soil to stay healthy."

41
00:02:35.993 --> 00:02:37.734
Mara and Roxy dug in the soil.

42
00:02:37.754 --> 00:02:41.756
"I can't wait until my sunflowers bloom," said Mara.

43
00:02:42.617 --> 00:02:44.578
"You have to plant them first!"

44
00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:45.959
Roxy laughed.

45
00:02:45.979 --> 00:02:48.540
"You know what this garden needs?"

46
00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:49.521
said Jack.

47
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:50.982
"A pond!"

48
00:02:51.002 --> 00:02:55.024
"I want a pond with frogs in it," said Mara.

49
00:02:55.692 --> 00:02:57.093
"And maybe some turtles."

50
00:02:58.394 --> 00:03:00.895
"Maybe Rocket Girl can dig a big pond for us!"

51
00:03:01.296 --> 00:03:01.936
said Terrell.

52
00:03:02.957 --> 00:03:04.037
Roxy rolled her eyes.

53
00:03:04.057 --> 00:03:07.740
"Rocket Girl is pretty busy, Terrell.

54
00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.761
She doesn't have time to dig a pond."

55
00:03:11.862 --> 00:03:12.683
Terrell shrugged.

56
00:03:13.763 --> 00:03:15.204
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

57
00:03:19.427 --> 00:03:20.908
Roxy stepped away from her friends.

58
00:03:26.168 --> 00:03:27.529
She pressed a button on her watch.

59
00:03:27.549 --> 00:03:32.230
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy.

60
00:03:32.911 --> 00:03:33.711
"What's wrong?"

61
00:03:33.731 --> 00:03:35.812
"Rocket Girl!"

62
00:03:36.072 --> 00:03:36.872
said Mayor Bloom.

63
00:03:36.892 --> 00:03:40.673
"Somebody is robbing Metro City Central Bank!"

64
00:03:40.693 --> 00:03:43.935
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

65
00:03:43.955 --> 00:03:46.216
"I'm on my way!"
